ources know that we are  enemies of a state and this is not uh  this is mainly about uh  psychological attack on readers and  users of internet uh rather than uh  there is a direct legal consequences  however uh many organizations are closed  down because not labeling their pages or  facebook posts uh with this special mark  which 24 words that you need to put  in  before before the text you want to post  on facebook and if you don't post it you  can be closed down and many people many  organizations are now being liquidated  because of violating of this law and uh  yeah our organization however so  uh we also in the in december of 2021  our website was also blocked in russia  and uh yeah i mean we are trying to do  our best uh i think that we use a lot of  our social networks  and we have a lot of connection with our  beneficiaries with people who we help  too because like we have a 24 hour by  seven hotline uh so that everyone who  are detained can call us and tell that's  going on  what's going on with them and so we have  a really good connection with the people  who we work for  that's why it makes us  more stable  and more resilient however of course we  are also in a danger as any other human  rights organization in russia looking  ahead do you feel like this moment could  be a turning point uh could it be a game  changer for dissent movements in russia  uh this is uh definitely a focal point  and we  well  game will be changed but  uh the question is in what direction  uh and uh russia now  are moving to  become the second north korea  and uh  it can be a successful movement but if  we if russian society refugees society  uh will show that they are not agree and  if this  uh if this will be successful movement  enough  then it will be a  turning point to a way better life than  like it was i mean  now many decisions are now going on and  uh  well russia will never be the same  definitely uh and unfortunately the more  probable probably it gonna be worse but  i think  it can also be  a bottom that we can just jump from  leonard dropkin thank you so much for  joining me on upfront  thank you thank you very much

